%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: HelgenKeep_Ralof
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I decide to head with Ralof.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474599036452922
    - rid: 9079474599036452924
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: We make our way into Helgen Keep.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474599036452926
    - rid: 9079474618519257089
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5c06fc500010bb4992b4b645db3d074, type: 2}
    dialog: Looks like we're the only ones who made it...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5c06fc500010bb4992b4b645db3d074, type: 2}
    dialog: That thing was a dragon, no doubt.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5c06fc500010bb4992b4b645db3d074, type: 2}
    dialog: Just like the children's stories and the legends. The harbingers of the
      End Times.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Heh. You've got <i>no</i> idea, buddy.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You mind helping me with these bindings, Ralof?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5c06fc500010bb4992b4b645db3d074, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah- come here.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I make my way over to Ralof, who cuts my bindings with an iron dagger.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5c06fc500010bb4992b4b645db3d074, type: 2}
    dialog: There you go.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5c06fc500010bb4992b4b645db3d074, type: 2}
    dialog: You might as well take Gunjar's gear. He won't be needing it anymore.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... you know, seeing Gunjar's dead body in person?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I'm surprised at how nonchalant Ralof is about the corpse of his comrade...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Don't know if that's a Nord thing, a 4th Era thing, a Tamriel thing,
      or just a Ralof thing.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I smell the gear before taking it off of Gunjar.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Just to make sure, you know.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Well, it smells bad, but it doesn't smell like... waste material, so
      I guess it's fine...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I take the gear off of Gunjar.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... now that I think about it, how am I supposed to put this on?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: In the game this sort of thing is abstracted away as a menu interaction...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey, Ralof, you mind giving me a hand with this?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5c06fc500010bb4992b4b645db3d074, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh? Have you never worn armor before, boy?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 'You know, his tone of voice doesn''t suggest anything, but the use of
      the word: "boy," really rubs me the wrong way.'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... no.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Ralof lets out a small chuckle, shakes his head, then comes over to help
      me.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: After I get the tunic on, I slip on the fur boots. Without Ralof's help.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... they don't fit that well, but I'm not exactly in a position to be
      picky right about now.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: There's also an iron axe at Gunjar's side, which I take.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474680798380212
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5c06fc500010bb4992b4b645db3d074, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm going to see if I can find a way out of here...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Ralof heads to the iron door on the other side of the room.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474680798380213
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: It's gonna be locked-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5c06fc500010bb4992b4b645db3d074, type: 2}
    dialog: This one's locked, let's see about that gate.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Told ya so.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5c06fc500010bb4992b4b645db3d074, type: 2}
    dialog: Damn. No way to open this from our side.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474680798380214
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: There should be some Imperials coming around right about now-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cc2df41360429a84496bc5d6151fc651, type: 2}
    dialog: Come on, soldier. Keep moving!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5c06fc500010bb4992b4b645db3d074, type: 2}
    dialog: It's the Imperials! Take cover!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cc2df41360429a84496bc5d6151fc651, type: 2}
    dialog: Get this gate open!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: If I remember right, that captain should have the key to get out of here.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5c06fc500010bb4992b4b645db3d074, type: 2}
    dialog: Imperial dogs!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Ralof charges in, going for the captain, which leaves me to deal with
      the other soldier...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474705638883382
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474705638883383
    - rid: 9079474705638883384
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... I just killed a man for the first time...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474705638883385
    - rid: 9079474705638883386
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5c06fc500010bb4992b4b645db3d074, type: 2}
    dialog: Maybe one of the Imperials had the key.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474705638883387
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Yep...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I search the Imperial captain's pockets, which was a lot harder to do
      than it is in game.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Sure enough, there's the key that will unlock the door.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5c06fc500010bb4992b4b645db3d074, type: 2}
    dialog: Did you find a key? Let's see if it unlocks that door.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I already know it will, so I promptly open the door, eager to move on
      from this experience.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474705638883389
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Jesus-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474705638883392
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Oh right, the ceiling caving in here was a scripted event in the game.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I guess that means the world I've found myself in follows the events
      of the game, to at least a certain degree.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: We make our way through the dining area, encountering more Imperials.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474705638883393
    - rid: 9079474705638883394
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
